  "_anchors_only_comment": "Tokens that contribute to convergence + graph but are never directly emitted as scene-tuple slots. They remain as player cards (motives, modifiers, legacy events) or graph anchors driving logit_bias. The buried-motive tokens (1884_transaction / alderton_silence / pre_register_money) are LATE phase and oblique by design — they carry the recontextualisation of the surface motive (boundary_fraud) into the buried motive (nineteen years of silence).",
